1
00:00:00,010 --> 00:00:01,550
(Được chép bởi TurboScribe. Nâng cấp lên Không giới hạn để gỡ bỏ thông báo này.) He is walking.

2
00:00:02,250 --> 00:00:04,130
A woman stops him.

3
00:00:04,930 --> 00:00:07,010
She asks if he is Christian.

4
00:00:07,930 --> 00:00:08,970
He says no.

5
00:00:09,770 --> 00:00:12,250
She says that he should be.

6
00:00:12,950 --> 00:00:14,430
She gives him a Bible.

7
00:00:15,410 --> 00:00:16,410
He takes it.

8
00:00:17,110 --> 00:00:18,130
He reads it.

9
00:00:18,810 --> 00:00:21,310
He thinks it is really interesting.

10
00:00:21,310 --> 00:00:24,310
He cannot put it down.

11
00:00:25,290 --> 00:00:27,350
He goes to a nearby church.

12
00:00:28,390 --> 00:00:29,470
He prays.
